#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:4
msgid "LMCache Frontend"
msgstr "LMCache 前端"

#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page documents the behavior of LMCache's in-process mode "
"(deprecated). Please consider using :doc:`LMCache MP mode </mp/index>` "
"for better feature support and performance. For the MP mode equivalent of"
" this page, see :doc:`/mp/frontend_dashboard`."
msgstr "本页面记录了 LMCache 的进程内模式（已弃用）的行为。请考虑使用 :doc:`LMCache MP 模式 </mp/index>` 以获得更好的功能支持和性能。有关此页面的 MP 模式等效项，请参见 :doc:`/mp/frontend_dashboard`。"

#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:11
msgid ""
"LMCache Frontend is a monitoring and proxy service for LMCache clusters, "
"providing a web interface for cluster management and HTTP request "
"proxying to cluster nodes."
msgstr ""
"LMCache Frontend 是一个用于 LMCache 集群的监控和代理服务，提供集群管理的 Web 界面以及对集群节点的 HTTP "
"请求代理。"

#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:15
msgid "LMCache Frontend Dashboard"
msgstr "LMCache 前端仪表板"

#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:21
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:23
msgid "**Cluster Monitoring**: Web-based dashboard for visualizing cluster status"
msgstr "**集群监控**\\ ：基于网页的仪表板，用于可视化集群状态"

#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Request Proxying**: HTTP proxy service to forward requests to any "
"cluster node"
msgstr "**请求代理**\\ ：HTTP 代理服务，用于将请求转发到任何集群节点"

#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Flexible Configuration**: Support for both IP:port and Unix domain "
"sockets"
msgstr "**灵活配置**\\ ：支持 IP:端口 和 Unix 域套接字"

#: ../../source/production/observability/frontend.rst:26
msgid "**Plugin System**: Integration with LMCache plugin framework"
msgstr "**插件系统**\\ ：与 LMCache 插件框架的集成"

